# 02 - Static Response API

API that returns static application information.

---

## Description

This project demonstrates how to return structured static JSON data using Express.

Unlike Hello World, this API returns a proper response structure like real world APIs.

---

## Run the Project

From root folder:

npm run dev:02

Or directly:

node projects/02-static-response-api/index.js

---

## API Endpoint

GET /

http://localhost:1198

---

## Response

{
  "success": true,
  "project": "02 - Static Response API",
  "message": "This API returns static application information",
  "appInfo": {
    "name": "Express Backend Lab",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "author": "Ashish Ranjan"
  }
}

---

